<title>USA: Broward Cty, Fla., $184 mln deal - 5.95 pct in 2028.</title>
<headline>Broward Cty, Fla., $184 mln deal - 5.95 pct in 2028.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Wednesday it tentatively priced $184.2 million Broward County, Fla., professional sports facilities tax revenue bonds at a top tax-exempt yield of 5.95 percent in 2028.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:  </p>
<p>BROWARD COUNTY, FLORIDA</p>
<p>RE: $184,195,000*</p>
<p>Professional Sports Facilities Tax Revenue Bonds</p>
<p>(Broward County Civic Arena Project)</p>
<p>THIS ISSUE WILL BE IN BOOK ENTRY FORM THROUGH THE FACILITIES OF DTC</p>
<p>NOTE THE ELIMINATION OF THE 1999 MATURITY.</p>
